[h2]REPACK, REDISTRIBUTION & PERMISSIONS[/h2]
This is a server-specific compilation of third-party modules. Ownership and intellectual property rights remain with their respective authors and rights holders. TECZ's package preparation and file signing do not transfer authorship or grant public reuse rights.

[b]No permission to repack, extract, decompile, modify, reupload, redistribute, resell or mirror the included third-party content is granted by this Workshop publication.[/b] Any such use requires authorization from the relevant rights holders and compliance with their applicable license or terms.

Where applicable, Bohemia Interactive's [url=https://www.bohemia.net/en/licenses/dayz-public-license-dpl]DayZ Public License[/url] applies only to material actually released under that license. It does not override the terms of third-party commercial mods.

[b]Package note:[/b] Data, texture, shortcut and compatibility PBOs are supporting files, not separate standalone products. Feature activation depends on server configuration.

